// PY-A: zip(a, b) —— 产出 (a[i], b[i]) 对，配合 `for x, y in ...` 解构；长度取较短者
//   （此前 zip 是裸 extern → 链接失败）
// expect: 11
// expect: 22
// expect: 33
// expect: 44
// expect: 11
// expect: 22
a = [1, 2, 3, 4]
b = [10, 20, 30, 40]
for x, y in zip(a, b):
    print(x + y)

c = [1, 2, 3]
d = [10, 20]
for x, y in zip(c, d):
    print(x + y)
